---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';
import Photo from '../components/Photo.astro';
import { hope, milestones, chairman } from '../data/content';
---
<Base title="About" description="Since 2021, a youth-led federation of chapters and campus embassies rebuilding Pakistan through conscious youth, intellectual growth and responsible leadership.">
  <PageHero crumb="About us" title="Since" accent="2021." lede="A youth-led federation of chapters and campus embassies, rebuilding Pakistan through conscious youth, intellectual growth and responsible leadership." image="/images/monument-backs.jpg" imageLabel="Group photo" />

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(72px,9vw,128px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,128px)">
    <div class="grid-auto reveal" style="--min:300px;--gap:56px;align-items:start">
      <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:380px">
        <div style="aspect-ratio:4/5;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden"><Photo src={chairman.photo} label="Chairman portrait" /></div>
        <div><div style="font-weight:700;font-size:17px">{chairman.name}</div><div class="muted" style="font-size:14px">{chairman.role}</div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="span2 min0">
        <div class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom:22px">Preamble · from the chairman</div>
        <p class="navy" style="margin:0;font-size:clamp(24px,2.8vw,38px);line-height:1.28;font-weight:500;text-wrap:pretty">“The connection between organisation and ideology is like the body and the soul. The body moves in service of the spirit, and the soul makes its home in the body.”</p>
        <p class="body" style="margin:28px 0 0;line-height:1.7;max-width:640px">HOPE is both a movement and a school of thought. Our structure welcomes everyone who believes in inclusivity; our ideas give every member the intellectual nourishment to lead. The manifesto is our shared guide to doing that work with excellence, at every step.</p>
        <a href="/library" class="link-underline" style="margin-top:24px">Read the full manifesto</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="bg-navy rel" style="overflow:hidden">
    <div class="rays" style="left:50%;bottom:-700px;width:1400px;height:1400px;transform:translateX(-50%);background:repeating-conic-gradient(rgba(246,194,50,.13) 0deg .9deg,transparent .9deg 6deg);-webkit-mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 12%,#000 13% 40%,transparent 60%);mask:radial-gradient(circle,transparent 0 12%,#000 13% 40%,transparent 60%)"></div>
    <div class="wrap rel" style="padding-top:clamp(72px,9vw,128px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,128px)">
      <div style="text-align:center;max-width:760px;margin:0 auto 64px">
        <div class="eyebrow gold">Our philosophy</div>
        <h2 class="display h2-xl">Two pillars of an ideal society</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid-auto reveal" style="--min:380px;--gap:2px;border-radius:28px;overflow:hidden">
        <div class="pil"><div class="pil-word gold">Justice</div><p>Granting every individual their due right, without discrimination. Justice isn't control through law or force; it's an inner strength that moves us to act by conscience. It builds trust, peace and stability. An unjust society can never truly prosper.</p></div>
        <div class="pil"><div class="pil-word">Awareness</div><p>More than knowing: the ability to turn knowledge into practice and decide with insight. Awareness frees people from blind imitation and gives them critical thought. One conscious person can redirect an unconscious crowd.</p></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)">
    <div class="wrap hope-grid">
      {hope.map((h) => (
        <div class="hope-cell">
          <div class="display d900 blue" style="font-size:clamp(120px,13vw,200px);line-height:.75" aria-hidden="true">{h.l}</div>
          <div class="display" style="font-size:30px;margin-top:16px">{h.w}</div>
          <p class="body" style="margin:0;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6">{h.d}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(72px,9vw,128px);padding-bottom:clamp(72px,9vw,128px)">
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:end;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:48px">
      <h2 class="display h2">Milestones</h2>
      <a href="/team" class="btn btn-outline btn-sm">Meet the leadership</a>
    </div>
    <ol class="miles reveal">
      {milestones.map((m) => (
        <li>
          <span class="dot"></span>
          <div class="display d900 blue" style="font-size:44px;margin-top:28px">{m.y}</div>
          <p class="body" style="margin:8px 0 32px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.55">{m.t}</p>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .pil { background: rgba(255,255,255,.06); padding: clamp(28px,4vw,56px); }
  .pil-word { font-family: var(--display); font-weight: 900; font-size: clamp(56px,8vw,120px); line-height: .8; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .pil p { margin: 24px 0 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: rgba(255,255,255,.84); }
  .hope-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%,260px),1fr)); }
  .hope-cell { padding: 48px 28px 44px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px; transition: background .25s; }
  .hope-cell:hover { background: var(--sand); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .hope-cell { border-left: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); padding: 36px 0; } }
  .miles { list-style: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%,200px),1fr)); }
  .miles li { padding: 0 20px 0 0; border-top: 3px solid var(--navy); position: relative; }
  .dot { position: absolute; top: -10px; left: 0; width: 17px; height: 17px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--gold); border: 3px solid var(--navy); }
</style>
